<title>UK: Bank Austria prices 100 million stg 15-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria prices 100 million stg 15-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Bank Austria AG bond, launched earlier Thursday, has been priced, sole manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  STATUTORY DEFICIENCY GUARANTEE FROM CITY OF VIENNA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     8.375     MATURITY    04.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.968    PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    98.968    SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  NONE	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.00 PCT GILT DUE 2012</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
